1:["$","main",null,{"className":"article enArticle","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"detailTop","children":[["$","$L6",null,{"className":"brand","href":"/en","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"SJ"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["SHANJIANG",["$","small",null,{"children":"MODULAR HOUSING"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/en/news","children":"Back to news"}],["$","a",null,{"className":"detailCta","href":"/en/#contact","children":"Get a quote →"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"articleHero","children":[["$","small",null,{"children":["Product Application","　·　","Jul 14, 2026"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"How Can Flat-Pack Containers Become an Efficient Office?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The value of a flat-pack container is not limited to one room. Like building blocks, modules can be organised into an office environment that fits the way a project team works."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"articleBody","children":[["$","aside",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"CONTENTS"}],[["$","a","Begin with people and movement",{"href":"#section-1","children":["0",1,"　","Begin with people and movement"]}],["$","a","Use combinations to solve scale",{"href":"#section-2","children":["0",2,"　","Use combinations to solve scale"]}],["$","a","Let the fit-out follow the use",{"href":"#section-3","children":["0",3,"　","Let the fit-out follow the use"]}]]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[[["$","section","Begin with people and movement",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Begin with people and movement"}],[["$","p","Project management, engineering, document control, meetings and reception have different working patterns. The layout should distinguish quiet work areas, shared collaboration space and visitor-facing areas.",{"children":"Project management, engineering, document control, meetings and reception have different working patterns. The layout should distinguish quiet work areas, shared collaboration space and visitor-facing areas."}],["$","p","The position of entrances, corridors and stairs also affects everyday efficiency, so crossing flows should be kept to a minimum.",{"children":"The position of entrances, corridors and stairs also affects everyday efficiency, so crossing flows should be kept to a minimum."}]]]}],["$","section","Use combinations to solve scale",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use combinations to solve scale"}],[["$","p","Parallel modules can form meeting rooms, open offices and reception spaces. Two-level combinations increase usable area on a limited site, while corridors and canopies improve movement in wet weather.",{"children":"Parallel modules can form meeting rooms, open offices and reception spaces. Two-level combinations increase usable area on a limited site, while corridors and canopies improve movement in wet weather."}],["$","p","The modular approach also allows the office to expand as the project develops instead of requiring every space on day one.",{"children":"The modular approach also allows the office to expand as the project develops instead of requiring every space on day one."}]]]}],["$","section","Let the fit-out follow the use",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Let the fit-out follow the use"}],[["$","p","Lighting, sockets, network, air conditioning, partitions and storage determine whether an office is genuinely useful. Confirming these details during planning reduces later rework.",{"children":"Lighting, sockets, network, air conditioning, partitions and storage determine whether an office is genuinely useful. Confirming these details during planning reduces later rework."}]]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"articleCallout","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Need a project-specific recommendation?"}],"$L7","$L8"]}]]}]]}],"$L9","$La"]}]
